WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:03.880
Prince of Jin

00:03.960 --> 00:05.360
My apologies

00:10.680 --> 00:11.360
What did you say?

00:11.440 --> 00:12.840
Prince of Jin cannot be found

00:12.920 --> 00:14.320
I've inquired in many places

00:14.400 --> 00:16.360
But no one knows Prince of Jin's whereabouts

00:16.440 --> 00:17.320
What about Father?

00:17.400 --> 00:18.280
The Minister's residence

00:18.440 --> 00:20.107
Has been surrounded by soldiers

00:20.240 --> 00:21.640
Oh no

00:22.480 --> 00:23.600
Princess, something's wrong

00:23.680 --> 00:24.800
I see a unit of soldiers

00:24.880 --> 00:26.280
Coming toward us

00:26.960 --> 00:27.560
A'da

00:27.640 --> 00:29.120
Try to delay the soldiers

00:29.200 --> 00:29.880
If they come in

00:29.960 --> 00:31.360
Don't resist

00:31.440 --> 00:31.880
A'jiao

00:32.040 --> 00:33.200
Go out the back door

00:33.280 --> 00:34.560
Go straight to the Minister's residence

00:34.640 --> 00:35.600
Try to see the master

00:35.720 --> 00:36.600
Tell him the situation

00:36.680 --> 00:38.080
What about you, Madam?

00:39.440 --> 00:40.840
I'll go find other uncles

00:40.920 --> 00:42.280
Ask for their help

00:42.360 --> 00:42.760
In any case

00:42.840 --> 00:44.240
Go first

00:50.120 --> 00:50.640
Hurry

00:50.720 --> 00:52.120
Hurry

00:52.280 --> 00:52.880
Hurry, hurry, hurry

00:52.960 --> 00:54.360
Faster

00:56.160 --> 00:57.320
Faster

00:57.400 --> 00:58.280
Princess

00:58.360 --> 00:59.760
Don't shout

00:59.840 --> 01:02.173
I know about Prince of Jin's situation

01:21.680 --> 01:22.440
Second son

01:22.520 --> 01:23.760
Second son

01:23.840 --> 01:24.200
Chu Huan

01:24.280 --> 01:25.680
Has confessed everything

01:28.680 --> 01:29.360
It was him

01:29.440 --> 01:30.600
Taking advantage of his position

01:30.680 --> 01:32.120
To privately deploy city defense troops

01:32.200 --> 01:33.640
And planned to abduct you

01:33.720 --> 01:35.387
To rebel in your name

01:38.720 --> 01:40.120
Impossible

01:40.280 --> 01:41.680
This is impossible

01:43.680 --> 01:45.080
According to his confession

01:45.680 --> 01:47.920
Everything was planned by him alone

01:48.720 --> 01:50.120
You truly didn't know

01:52.040 --> 01:53.680
What a loyal dog

01:53.960 --> 01:55.760
Clearly seeing the situation

01:56.440 --> 01:57.800
Just admit to following orders

01:57.880 --> 01:59.120
And he could save himself

01:59.200 --> 02:00.640
This crime that warrants execution of nine clans

02:00.760 --> 02:02.760
He took it all upon himself

02:03.440 --> 02:05.680
The Chu family, all loyal and righteous

02:07.640 --> 02:09.040
What a pity
